OL,3,AAsos warns customers about full extent
OL,4,Aof data breach after BBC contacted by
OL,5,Ahackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos has told its customers hackers are
OL,8,Fin possession of detailed profiles of
OL,9,Fpotentially millions of the online
OL,10,Fstore's users.
OL,12,FIt issued the update after BBC News
OL,13,Ftold the retailer it had been contacted
OL,14,Fby cyber criminals who said this week's
OL,15,Fbreach went beyond "basic contact
OL,16,Fdetails" Asos previously said might
OL,17,Fhave been accessed.
OL,19,FNames, addresses, phone numbers, emails
OL,20,Fand customer numbers are now in the
OL,21,Fhands of cyber criminals.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
