OL,3,AAsos warns customers about full extent
OL,4,Aof data breach after BBC contacted by
OL,5,Ahackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo too are the searches customers have
OL,8,Fmade on the website. Terms like
OL,9,F"reclaimed vintage", "glamorous wide
OL,10,Ffit" and "Asos petite" are visible in
OL,11,Fthe data.
